WEBVTT

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.480
Next order of business.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.900
Black
Cat
Contractors

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.030
The Damashigamis are becoming 
increasingly active these days.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.390
As you are well aware,

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.910
Damashigamis are malicious 
shinigami that take

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.760
the lives of people who aren't

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.040
otherwise scheduled to die.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.670
President, are you sick?

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.110
Don't worry, it's not that bad.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:47.780
So anyway, you can make money 
apprehending Damashigamis, Rinne-sama.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.980
Money.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:53.800
Isn't that great?
Now we can buy a fan!

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:56.980
Summer flu, Rokumon?

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:01.670
Don't worry, it's not that bad.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.010
Damashigami Company

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.670
Rokudou-kun.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.480
Why weren't you at school today?

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.210
Are you okay?

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.440
S-Sakura-sama.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.430
M-Mamiya Sakura.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.170
Go home.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.410
It'll spread.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:56.070
That's not a problem. 
It won't spread to the living.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.350
It's an afterlife strain of influenza.

00:02:59.350 --> 00:03:01.070
You're in danger, Mamiya-san.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.700
Tsubasa-kun.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.700
You shouldn't go near them.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:08.120
But they said it won't spread to me.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.280
Mistaking sympathy for 
a weakened man for love.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.750
It happens.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.790
It's a mistake, Mamiya-san.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:20.120
I wish I could spread my flu to that idiot.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.340
I agree.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:28.890
Rokudou-kun lives by himself.
He has it rough.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.240
What about his family?

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.160
His grandma is his only relative.

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:35.320
His grandpa passed away.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.610
I see...

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.990
I'm the doctor.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.200
I'm the nurse.

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.700
House call!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:50.980
House call?

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:56.550
Let's give you your injection.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.800
I never asked for a doctor.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:02.880
Not to worry, I came by 
request of your relatives.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.760
Relatives? My grandma?

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.640
Yes, yes.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.270
Ah, that's better.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.570
Take this!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.410
Prepare yourself!

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.330
Shinigami scythe!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.010
Bonk.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.610
What's going on?

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.700
Rinne-sama, they're Damashigamis!

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.220
How dare you?!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.470
Huh?

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.330
Why are Damashigamis after Rokudou-kun?

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.810
He said his relatives sent them.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:04:59.770
But...

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:04.030
His grandmother would 
never do something like this.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.590
Who sent you?

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:07.780
I can't say,

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:10.080
no matter what you do to me.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.080
Oh?

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.600
I'll give you my flu.

00:05:15.320 --> 00:05:16.960
Stop! I'll talk!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:18.980
You will, huh?

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:20.590
Well...

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.770
It's a cover-up.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.410
By whom?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:29.950
<i>No.</i>

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.640
<i>It can't be him.</i>

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:40.240
Either way, we get money for 
apprehending Damashigamis!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.520
Now we can buy medicine!

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.620
I'll go hand them over 
to the authorities now.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.800
Why is Rokudou so poor?

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:55.290
From what Rokumon-chan told me,

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.620
his shinigami grandma fell in love with 
a human man who was supposed to die,

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.460
and extended his lifespan.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:09.720
That extended lifespan became debt, 
and Rokudou-kun's paying it off in her place.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:14.620
<i>But his grandma didn't look like 
the kind of awful person that would</i>

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.380
<i>hand all her debt to her grandson.</i>

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:20.900
<i>It didn't look like Rokudou-kun 
was angry at her, either.</i>

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.080
<i>Something's not right.</i>

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.010
Mamiya-san,

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:28.610
you're just asking for trouble, falling 
in love with a financially troubled man.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.870
But look at me, I can buy 
all the Holy Ash I want!

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.460
<i>I don't want any.</i>

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.620
<i>That's not even what I was talking about.</i>

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.720
Rinne-sama!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.150
The money! The money!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:54.510
Authorities

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:51.760
I went to the authorities to hand 
over the Damashigamis, when...

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.510
We'll be making a direct deposit.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.270
Bank

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.970
And when I tried to withdraw some money,

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.120
my balance was less than 
zero; it was negative!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:14.900
What?!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.440
Are you alive, Rokudou?

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.080
We're here to check on you.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.040
Wh-What?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:30.740
What is this?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.050
Payment Required
 Rokudou Sabato
 Amount: 30,000 yen
 Borrower: Rokudou Sabato
 Co-signer: Rokudou Rinne

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.050
<i>Payment Required?</i>

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:51.780
Sorry, Rinne. I used up all your money.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:53.780
You!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:57.530
Don't tell me you're living 
in a place like this.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.500
Dad's worried.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:01.290
Dad?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.580
What gives you the 
right to act like a father?

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:07.110
This person is Rokudou-kun's father?

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.780
I guess they do sort of look alike.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.090
He's so young.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.780
You don't have power, huh?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.170
And you don't have any furniture 
that you could sell.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.500
Why are you so poor?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.520
<i>Why</i>?

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:24.560
It's all your fault!

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:30.550
I'll apologize for using up all your money.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:32.520
It's not just this once.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:39.740
You've been borrowing money all the 
time using me as your co-signer!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:46.770
<i>A co-signer is someone who pays for 
a loan when the borrower fails to.</i>

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:50.410
<i>You must never become a co-signer 
for someone you don't trust.</i>

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.320
<i>Never! Ever!</i>

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:56.760
It wasn't Grandma Tamako's 
loan you were paying off?

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.970
But that's what Tamako-sama told me.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:05.090
You're the one that called over a 
Damashigami to attack me yesterday, aren't you?!

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:09.320
That, Rinne, is for your sake.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.530
It's my fatherly love—

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:12.820
I heard a crack.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.530
So it <i>was</i> your doing.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.910
If you have to be so poor 
living in your current life,

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:24.570
you'd be better off working as a 
Damashigami with me in the afterlife.

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.590
What's the commotion?

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.550
This way, everyone.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.340
Let's go!

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:43.310
One, two...

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.770
It's a huge catch!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.970
What are those women doing?!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:50.730
They can't be...

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.020
Let's go.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.070
Damn Damashigamis!

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.110
Eek!

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.130
What...

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:02.740
...were we doing?

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:03.740
Let's run!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:10.130
Hooah! One, two, one, two...

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.780
Oh, no!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:07.830
They got away!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.650
Haven't you learned your lesson?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.710
Bad boy, Rinne.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:19.890
You're obstructing business.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:22.600
Boss!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.930
Boss?

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:29.060
Indeed. I'm the president of limited 
legality company Damashigami Company LLC,

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.810
Rokudou Sabato.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.730
Hand over my scythe!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:42.990
Rinne, quit clinging to the living world 
and come with your dad to the afterlife.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.080
No!

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:48.410
You'll come. Guaranteed.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.030
Rokudou-kun.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:00.930
Now you know my embarrassing secret.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:06.720
So your dad's a Damashigami.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.990
<i>A Damashigami, who takes the</i>

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:12.840
<i>lifespans of people who 
aren't supposed to die yet</i>

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:13.860
<i>in order to satisfy their quota.</i>

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:17.360
<i>To think their leader was his dad.</i>

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:21.430
<i>That's why he hates Damashigamis so much.</i>

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:27.740
<i>But why was his dad so confident?</i>

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.880
Rinne-sama, let's go back to your room.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.950
You should really lie down.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.880
Man, this is such a headache.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:43.340
The tatami mat's gone!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.850
Mrowwr!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:51.890
Mamiya Sakura, Jumonji, you guys stay behind!

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.820
It's not a place for normal people to go!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.760
It's too late for that.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:59.030
We've been there plenty of times already.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.990
Besides, we can't just leave you.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:08.440
He actually just took his 
sick son's tatami, though.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.410
He's one heartless dad.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.510
See? I told you you'd come.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:27.460
For you to become a Damashigami is 
something your mother wants as well.

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:28.830
Mom?

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:39.000
Th-The tatami's sucking us in!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.080
One, two, three!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:55.870
Congratulations on paying off your debt

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:55.870
That was ten years ago, back when I was 
still living with Grandma and Grandpa.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.840
Congratulations on clearing 
off your loan, Grandma.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.020
Stop calling me that.

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:03.380
My temples! Ow! Ow!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.620
You worked hard, Tamako.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.410
Oh, what's that sound?

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:10.810
It came from Rinne's room.

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:15.310
Oh, my.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.690
My piggy bank!

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.160
Come on, now. It's me, Dad.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.360
Dad would only come back occasionally.

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:28.940
I was told my mom lived in a far-off town.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.240
Until then...

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.850
Give it back!

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:34.840
That's my train fare to go see Mom!

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:37.500
How touching.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.750
Saving money to go see Mom.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:42.850
But you know...

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:51.220
Mom's already dead!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:52.470
What?!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:57.140
I'll pay you back double, okay?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:57.730
Got it?

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.770
You scum of the earth!

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:17.640
<i>So Tamako-san was already 
done paying off her own debt.</i>

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.940
<i>But Rokudou-kun's Mom...</i>

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:26.330
You clearly said that Mom was dead.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:27.970
Are you telling me that was a lie?

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:31.410
I was young, too.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:35.930
I must have thought I could 
raise you by myself without Mom.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.260
Just to be clear, I don't remember 
ever being raised by you.

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:42.440
I was busy.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.830
His grandma's a shinigami, 
and his grandpa's human.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.780
And his dad's a Damashigami.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.410
Then what about your mom?

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:51.520
I don't know.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.450
No one would tell me.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.770
Now, Rinne, your mom's waiting.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.210
Nice to meet you, Rinne-kun.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.340
You look just like Boss!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.090
You can call me Mom.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.740
We'll be good to each other.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:14.720
Let's be Damashigamis together.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:17.100
Pick me!

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.230
You.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:22.950
What is this?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:24.520
Don't you see?

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:31.240
First Rinne Cup
Mom Competition

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:31.240
"First Rinne Cup, Mom Competition."

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:32.810
An audition?

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:33.690
Wait.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:38.750
<i>First</i>? You mean there's going 
to be a second and a third?

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:42.750
Yes, and finally there'll 
be a Grand Championship.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:46.020
So what's up with the women?!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.380
Oh, you see...

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.700
They <i>all</i> want to marry me.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:56.900
But I love them all, and I can't choose.

00:15:56.900 --> 00:16:00.080
You're his son, Rinne-kun, 
so we want you to choose.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.270
<3.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.340
These are all his girlfriends?!

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:07.830
And there're both humans and shinigamis!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.190
Humans?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:15.320
So they're victims that were 
taken here from the living world?

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:18.410
Nah, cute girl.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.120
We came with him.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.180
Sabato-sama's so handsome.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.580
And he spends so much money on us.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.280
There you go, presents!

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.750
Handbags!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:30.270
Jewelry!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:31.720
Fur!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.450
Crab!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.730
Stock certificates!

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:39.020
You were using my money to lure in women?

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:40.370
You fiend!

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:45.060
You can make as much money 
as you want as a Damashigami.

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.810
Rinne, become heir to the company.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.840
I bet the company's swamped in debt, too!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.240
Bingo.

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.810
That's my boy.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.050
So shrewd.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.660
It's a trope!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.390
Mamiya Sakura!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:06.540
Rokumon!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.550
...Jumonji!

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:10.090
What do you think you're doing?

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:12.020
Relax.

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:14.520
I'm sending them back to the living world.

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:15.530
But...

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:20.930
I'm only sending them back after you 
promise to become a Damashigami.

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:27.540
If you say "no," I'll send them 
both to the Rinne no Wa.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:32.900
In other words, their lives, 
Rinne, depend on your answer.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:37.100
Rinne-kun already left.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:37.910
Huh?

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:44.660
Where am I?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.060
A prison home?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.230
Rokumon-chan!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.380
Tsubasa-kun!

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:54.760
We all got captured separately.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.440
Hurry! Hurry!

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:59.510
The young president's induction celebration!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.660
Young president?

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.010
Rokudou-kun?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:04.870
It's a huge party!

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.790
The young president's treat!

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.150
We get all-you-can-eat Japanese Black Beef!

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:12.810
<i>They're having Japanese Black 
Beef using Rokudou-kun's money?!</i>

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:14.650
<i>That's terrible!</i>

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:16.070
We have to stop them!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.730
Let me out!

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:18.710
Quiet down!

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:19.810
Eat!

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:26.910
I'm out.

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:29.550
<i>Meanwhile, Jumonji...</i>

00:18:29.550 --> 00:18:31.520
Mamiya-san, where are you?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:33.550
<i>...had also managed to get out.</i>

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.330
Boss, the hostages have escaped.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:39.240
Are you serious?

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.340
They're so stupid.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.680
They're Damashigami food 
if they leave the place.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.690
<i>We will soon begin the new 
president's induction ceremony.</i>

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:55.270
<i>All staff please gather 
in the Large Banquet Hall.</i>

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.210
Mamiya Sakura, where are you?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.610
We're going back to the living world!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.050
Look, it's the young president!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.580
Rinne-sama!

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:10.000
I heard he's hooking up with 
the first person to catch him!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.830
Time to marry rich!

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.400
President's wife!

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.130
I get to be Sabato-sama's daughter-in-law!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.510
How did we get from the 
Mom Championship to this?

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:20.850
Move!

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.960
I don't have time for you!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.510
Rinne-sama!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.970
What's your problem?

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:30.890
We found him first.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.100
The first person to touch him wins.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:35.170
Boop, boop.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.660
What are you talking about?

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.990
Rinne-sama isn't putting up with you!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:42.750
You'll go out with me, right, Rinne-sama?

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:43.860
With me, right?

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:46.830
Let's get engaged! 
Make me a president's wife!

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:52.120
I see, so that's the deal.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:56.440
I'm disappointed, Rokudou!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.760
Jumonji.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.180
You were safe.

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:02.890
Everyone that attacked me was weak.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.910
The stuffed animal squad's down!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:14.300
So you left Mamiya-san alone in this 
insane place to go chasing girls.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.160
How could you! Holy Ash!

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.190
What is this?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.990
I can't move!

00:20:23.650 --> 00:20:25.640
Take care of the rest, Jumonji!

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.200
What?!

00:20:27.220 --> 00:20:28.610
I don't get it.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:32.370
What is it about that cold-hearted 
guy that Mamiya-san likes?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.840
Love Fortune-telling

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.840
You look to be troubled by love, mister.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.190
Love Fortune-telling

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:42.840
I'll read your fortune with her for cheap.

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:44.440
I'm not falling for it!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:46.720
It's a scam, isn't it?

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:52.990
There's a way to take her 
heart all for yourself.

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:53.650
Twitch!

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.770
<i>Meanwhile, Mamiya Sakura...</i>

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.310
Where's the banquet hall?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.010
<i>...was lost, not surprisingly.</i>

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:05.590
Hurry, the ceremony's starting!

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.070
Wait, I'm coming, too!

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.870
I made it.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.080
Whisper, whisper...

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.880
It's that escaped human girl!

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:20.250
Suspect

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.250
She has a bounty on her!

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.630
Shoot!

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:26.970
There's nowhere for you to 
run in this tiny elevator!

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:32.710
Are you okay, Mamiya-san?

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.480
Thanks, Tsubasa-kun. I'm saved.

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.380
<i>This is a pendant of relationship success.</i>

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:48.020
<i>With this, your love will come to fruition!</i>

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:52.660
It worked!

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:55.790
This pendant's the real deal!

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:01.160
We have a letter from TJ-san of Tokyo.

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:04.880
I've gotten closer to her, 
thanks to the pendant!

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:06.920
I can't believe it!

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:09.730
I'm so glad I spent 5,000 yen on it!

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:11.050
5,000 yen?

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:12.870
That's expensive, Tsubasa-kun.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.140
You got ripped off.

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:27.570
Young President's Induction
& Engagement Announcement

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:30.990
Engagement announcement?

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
 The Young President's Induction?!

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:04.670
Tsubasa-kun, have you ever 
thought about your future?

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:08.550
Could this be an "I'm going 
to marry Tsubasa-kun,

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:12.310
so let's think about our future 
together" kind of thing?

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:14.370
You can do whatever you like.

00:24:14.370 --> 00:24:15.320
Huh? Why?

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:16.800
Was that too irresponsible?

00:24:17.080 --> 00:24:19.070
All right, I'll choose everything!

00:24:19.070 --> 00:24:22.930
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"The Young President's Induction?!"

00:24:22.930 --> 00:24:25.290
Tsubasa-kun's being kind of weird.
